# NOTE: pnpm 10+ reads project settings from pnpm-workspace.yaml, NOT from here.
# node-linker / fetch-timeout / fetch-retries / network-concurrency now live in
# pnpm-workspace.yaml (as nodeLinker / fetchTimeout / fetchRetries /
# networkConcurrency). They sat in this file being silently ignored after the
# pnpm upgrade, which is what broke Expo/Metro bundling — keep them there.
#
# This file is intentionally left without those settings so there is one home
# for them rather than two that disagree.
